WHAT THIS COVERS · 适用范围

  The dataset: every file under `data/` in the source repository
  (`data/entities.json`, `data/seed/*.json`, `data/live/*.json`, `data/graph.json`),
  the published `data/graph.json` and `data/archive/YYYY-MM-DD.json` on the live
  site, and the CSV that the site's table view downloads.

