HOW TO CREDIT · 署名方式

  AI Orders & Debt Map, helajo, <date of the snapshot you used>,
  https://helajo.github.io/ai-orders-debt-live/

  A snapshot's date is `generated_at` in `data/graph.json`, or the file name
  under `data/archive/`. If you use one deal, its `sources` list names the
  filing or article the figure comes from; please cite that too.

  快照日期即 `data/graph.json` 中的 `generated_at`，或 `data/archive/` 下的文件名。
  引用单笔交易时，其 `sources` 列出了金额的出处，请一并注明。

